This is the SamFileTransfer CLI — a client for connecting to the
SamFileTransfer service at https://samfiletransfer.com.

You're welcome to install it and use it, free of charge, to connect to a
SamFileTransfer pool — for personal use or inside your own company.

What we'd ask you not to do without checking with us first: redistribute,
mirror, or resell the CLI anywhere other than the official npm package
("samfiletransfer"). If you have a reason to want that, reach out first;
we're easy to talk to.

The CLI is provided "as is", with no warranty of any kind, express or
implied. SamFileTransfer isn't liable for damages arising from its use.

